## Examples

```python
tables = {"t": [{"a": 1, "b": "x"}, {"a": 2, "b": "y"}]}

query("SELECT a FROM t WHERE a > 1", tables)
# [{"a": 2}]

query("SELECT COUNT(*) AS n, SUM(a) FROM t", tables)
# [{"n": 2, "SUM(a)": 3}]

query("SELECT b, COUNT(*) AS n FROM t GROUP BY b ORDER BY b DESC", tables)
# [{"b": "y", "n": 1}, {"b": "x", "n": 1}]
```

